<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 100 million mark bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 100 million mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by lead manager BHF-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.50	MATURITY   *25.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE    25.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    HANOVER   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES   ** FOR FIRST YEAR, 6.00 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	    * CALL OPTION AT PAR ON 25.SEP.97</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 675</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
